  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>斯巴達武器附加工具包是一個能輕鬆製作<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達武器</a>附加組件的函式庫。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8e635bf06a942326908c05bf879e993e7e6658b4.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>斯巴達武器附加工具包</strong>只需指定材料，即可自動註冊完整的武器套組。此工具包還能處理資料生成，包括標籤、物品模型與合成配方。此外，它也解決了斯巴達武器API中存在的若干問題。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若您有興趣在自己的模組中使用此函式庫，歡迎查看<a href=\"https://github.com/KreloX/SpartanToolkit\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub頁面</a>（施工中）。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>應用於：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-ice-and-fire\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達武器：冰與火</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達武器：以太</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達武器：暮光森林</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達武器：深淵花園</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達武器：藍天</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-simpleores\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達武器：簡易礦物</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-gobber\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達武器：哥布林</a></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252fkreloxkinetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://1drv.ms/i/c/6bf544900f9867ae/IQR3yxNMtle9S4RxniPeeGgMAVrcnQ4U65DGA1uiSdBUIbE?width=837&amp;height=80&amp;n=-1\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"> </a></p>",
